repository-code: >-
  https://codeberg.org/CE-RISE-software/intelligent-circular-insights
abstract: >-
  A neuro-symbolic workbench for querying Digital Product Passports, in which
  every output is an evidence-grounded answer with provenance or an explicit
  abstention. Hybrid retrieval and persistent product-scoped fact memory gather
  evidence; targeted symbolic validation over a DPP ontology derives obligations
  with rule traces; a grounding verifier rejects any claim that cannot be
  resolved against the gathered evidence; and a calibrated selective layer
  decides whether to answer at an operating point reported with the response.
  Two interchangeable backends are switchable per request: a fast path over flat
  product profiles and published emission factors, and a CE-RISE path over the
  consortium data models and the WP3 PEFDPP ontology.
keywords:
  - CE-RISE
  - Digital Product Passport
